OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers' flu left me deaf in both
OL,4,Aears - I'm now helping people like me
OL,5,Adrive
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Darcie Parker turned up for her
OL,8,Ffirst day at university, she had no
OL,9,Fidea a case of freshers' flu would
OL,10,Fleave her profoundly deaf in both ears.
OL,12,FThe 22-year-old said she assumed not
OL,13,Fbeing able to hear was part of the
OL,14,Fillness, but was told by medics a week
OL,15,Flater that her hearing would not come
OL,16,Fback.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
