OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers' flu left me deaf in both
OL,4,Aears - I'm now helping people like me
OL,5,Adrive
OL,6,
OL,7,FDarcie went on to complete her degree
OL,8,Fat The Academy of Contemporary Music in
OL,9,FBirmingham, trained to become a
OL,10,Fteacher, and later passed her driving
OL,11,Ftest following the challenging task of
OL,12,Ffinding someone willing to teach her.
OL,14,FNow she has partnered with her driving
OL,15,Finstructor to create a course about
OL,16,Fteaching deaf people how to drive.
